      },
      "question": "Read the extract and answer the questions.\n\n*Don't bite your nails, Amanda!*\n*Don't hunch your shoulders, Amanda!*\n*Stop that slouching and sit up straight,*\n*Amanda!*\n\n(i) Who is probably speaking?\n\n(ii) What is the tone of the speaker?\n\n(iii) Name the device in the repeated 'Amanda!'.\n\n(iv) What does 'slouching' mean?\n\n(v) How does Amanda react to such instructions?",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "answer_steps": [
        "(i) Amanda's mother.",
        "(ii) Nagging, commanding.",
        "(iii) Repetition.",
        "(iv) Sitting or standing lazily with drooping shoulders.",
        "(v) She escapes into daydreams."
      ],
      "marking_scheme": [
        "(i) 1 mark",
        "(ii) 1 mark",
        "(iii) 1 mark",
        "(iv) 1 mark",
        "(v) 1 mark"
      ]
    },
