      },
      "question": "Read the extract and answer the questions.\n\n*(I am Rapunzel, I have not a care;*\n*life in a tower is tranquil and rare;*\n*I'll certainly never let down my bright hair!)*\n\n(i) Who is 'I'?\n\n(ii) Why is this stanza in brackets?\n\n(iii) What does 'tranquil' mean?\n\n(iv) Why will she never let down her hair?\n\n(v) What does she long for?",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "answer_steps": [
        "(i) Amanda, imagining herself as Rapunzel.",
        "(ii) It is her private daydream.",
        "(iii) Calm and peaceful.",
        "(iv) So no one can climb up and disturb her peace.",
        "(v) Peace and freedom."
      ],
      "marking_scheme": [
        "(i) 1 mark",
